Provides: picompose-audio-driver
Conflicts: picompose-audio-driver
Replaces: picompose-audio-driver
Description: PiCompose driver for the ReSpeaker 2-Mics and 4-Mics Pi HAT
 Kernel module (built with DKMS), device tree overlays and audio setup for
 the Seeed ReSpeaker 2-Mics, 4-Mics and 6-Mics Pi HATs (WM8960 and AC108
 codecs). A service detects the HAT on the I2C bus at the first start,
 configures it and reboots the system once.
 .
 The package provides picompose-audio-driver, so only one audio driver package
 can be installed.
